    "pages": [
      {
        "id": "p0",
        "title": "Power",
        "text": "Power starts at 100% when a combo begins, and every move you throw knocks it down - later hits deal less damage and usually leave less time for the next juggle hit. Don't go hunting for a universal 'combo ends at 30%' rule; the route, move, height, and character all still matter."
      },
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "title": "Guts",
        "text": "Guts is the defender's safety net: the lower their Life, the less damage they take. And on your side, a fuller RF Gauge gives your hits a small damage boost."
      }
    ],
